WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.055
Why a shower has a name.

00:02.755 --> 00:10.624
The meteors of one shower all seem to come from one point in the sky, and a shower is named for the figure that point is in.

00:11.074 --> 00:14.783
The Perseids of August seem to come from here, in Perseus.

00:15.233 --> 00:17.632
The figure is only a signpost.

00:18.082 --> 00:22.351
The meteors themselves are dust from a comet called Swift-Tuttle.
